# oracle: an atom that moves more than a box length between reneighborings is lost: Domain::pbc wraps a periodic coordinate by one period and the exchange that follows drops an atom still outside the box (thermo_modify lost warn; atom 7 at vx 2000 moves 10 per step in a 5.04 box)
# oracle-compare: thermo=all
units           lj
atom_style      atomic
lattice         fcc 0.8442
region          box block 0 3 0 3 0 3
create_box      1 box
create_atoms    1 box
mass            1 1.0
velocity        all create 1.0 87287 loop geom
set             atom 7 vx 2000.0
pair_style      lj/cut 2.5
pair_coeff      1 1 1.0 1.0 2.5
neighbor        0.3 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
fix             1 all nve
thermo          1
thermo_style    custom step atoms temp pe press
thermo_modify   lost warn format float %.15g
run             5
